  "claim_scope": "The original same-occurrence residual material yields its real dependent environment/increment projections. On every actual named continuous-frame stage the complete raw Env is the original native point environment at actorClock-1; the already generated original A maps raw to active, and B returns that actual-image raw word. The original actual macro registration increment is full Env zero on paid steps and active-raw on settled steps; only afterward its native source coordinate is recognized as E(raw). Existing character/full logic fibre/update fibre/cochain/source receipt and canonical birth next/compiles consume that same original raw source and actual increment directly.",
  "certified_machine_facts": [
    "All three frozen production files and the 13-mouth RawAction direct gate independently pass fresh trust0/warningAsError. Generic import and full pressure provenance gates also pass.",
    "The two generic modules have an actual 209-module core, zero domain imports and universe-u public mouths. The production/direct gate graph is 747; full inherited pressure graph is 749. All 746 prior dependencies exactly match formal CP77 source/import/OLean receipts and were reused without recompilation.",
    "material_environment/material_increment eliminate the actual dependent occurrence constructor of the existing residualMaterial. raw_environment restores the actual registered request input environment, with the source-generated zero increment; no target equality is a source input.",
    "raw_env is a full Env equality on every actual frameAt stage, derived from the real initial residual registration and original paid/settled next branches. The positive source clock justifies actorClock-1 without a hidden zero-case substitution.",
    "action_raw_active consumes the existing full native A(source point) law and the actual frames_env invariant. raw_inverse consumes the already paid complete coimage/source-word inverse on that actual A-image. No actor cursor projection is used to establish them.",
    "Generic Increment.actual first generates the full Env registration delta from the actual source action and original nextBorn/raw registration. native_increment then projects the native source coordinate: paid0, settled E(raw).",
    "native_effect_nonzero recovers complete native words from a supposed coimage equality and uses the genuine source-clock successor inequality. paid_zero and paid_rejects_unconditional_effect establish the key zero-versus-nonzero negative control.",
    "Actual paid non-vacuity is the existing formal CP77 actual_paid_after_birth control on the identical frameAt/dynamicFeed/continuous family; no new paid witness or payment was constructed.",
    "character_and_actual_delta directly pairs the original character_source_read and same-stage increment_branch at offset+index.val, retaining their precise dependent types. No copied normalized match formula is claimed.",
    "Original complete_source_word, update_fibre_iff, cochain_presented_comp_zero, actual_source_receipt and Births actual_next/actual_compiles are direct consumers of this same original source/current.",
    "All 13 key mouths use only propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. The 58,458-declaration closure of all 33 owned logical roots has unsafe0/partial0/unresolved0. The inherited compiler actorClock._unsafe_rec is separately inspected and absent from that logical closure."
  ],
